OL,3,GNEWSAMPs and MSP detained by Israel and
OL,4,Abarred from entering West Bank
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Israeli embassy
OL,7,Fin the UK claimed the group "failed to
OL,8,Fcooperate with border officials" and
OL,9,Fprovided "false information about the
OL,10,Fpurpose of their visit".
